@participant1 Thanks for your interest on this.

There is no any feedback from other maintainers yet, but I think we must do this because both `github.com/golang/protobuf` and `github.com/gogo/protobuf` are deprected, it's just a matter of time. 

Since it's a big change, so please evaluate the impact and provide a detailed plan firstly. Afterwards, we can update the [functional_test](https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/tree/main/tests/functional) in the first step.

@reporter I can look at this problem.

